          <div class="faq-list" data-reveal>
            <details open>
              <summary>What is TopPay?</summary>
              <p>The supplied TopPay screens show USDT and INR access, INR tasks, UPI, team tools and account settings. This independent guide explains those screens and links to the supplied registration page.</p>
            </details>
            <details>
              <summary>How do I register or download TopPay?</summary>
              <p>Use Register or Download app on this website. The registration guide and app download guide open on <strong>toppay-offical.website</strong>. Follow the destination page’s current instructions. This guide does not host an APK file. Use the registration instructions and the destination shown there.</p>
            </details>
            <details>
              <summary>What USDT to INR rate is used here?</summary>
              <p>The supplied screenshot shows a ratio of <strong>1 USDT ≈ ₹<span data-rate>109.65</span>
                </strong>. For example, 100 USDT is ₹10,965 before fees at the screenshot rate. The calculator is an estimate; confirm the current rate and charges inside TopPay.</p>
            </details>
            <details>
              <summary>What does the 4% task example mean?</summary>
              <p>The task screenshot shows ₹980 income on a ₹24,500 task, which is <span data-commission-rate>4</span>% of the amount. A ₹1,000 amount would give ₹40 at that same percentage. These are arithmetic examples; eligibility and actual amounts depend on current task terms. The 2% bonus ratio is separate.</p>
            </details>
            <details>
              <summary>Where do I log in or reset my password?</summary>
              <p>Open the <a class="login-link" href="https://toppay-offical.website/" rel="noopener noreferrer">supplied TopPay app page</a> to log in. The <a class="forgot-link" href="https://toppay-offical.website/toppay-password-help.html" rel="noopener noreferrer">password recovery page</a> opens on the account recovery domain. Account details are entered on that destination.</p>
            </details>
            <details>
              <summary>Can I deposit or withdraw on toppay-offical.website?</summary>
              <p>This public guide does not process payments. Accounts, deposits, withdrawals and orders are managed by the linked platform. For account questions, use Contact Us or the help options inside TopPay.</p>
            </details>
            <details>
          <summary>Is toppay-offical.website the TopPay official website?</summary>
              <p>This website provides TopPay login access and public app guides. Its app and guide links use toppay-offical.website. It does not operate the payment service or represent a bank.</p>
            </details>
